WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.750
The lab exports the evidence Step
9 files each month, from a test

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:08.375
management group where someone has
assigned the guide's security initiative.

3
00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:12.610
Every command reads, the only thing
written is a folder on your machine,

4
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.362
and the authors haven't run it.

5
00:00:14.362 --> 00:00:18.273
Step one shows the initiative's
enforcement mode: do-not-enforce

6
00:00:18.273 --> 00:00:22.551
during the audit phase, Default once
the compliance review has passed.

7
00:00:22.551 --> 00:00:26.438
Step two looks up one built-in
definition in the cloud you're in.

8
00:00:26.438 --> 00:00:31.788
Step three exports this month's compliance:
the summary and the non-compliant list.

9
00:00:31.788 --> 00:00:36.363
The guide's Validate step says the
summary shows the initiative's compliance.

10
00:00:36.363 --> 00:00:40.366
Step four lists the exemptions with
their category and expiry, using the

11
00:00:40.366 --> 00:00:44.837
management-group example from Learn's
reference for the exemption list command.

12
00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:49.156
Expect no exemption past its
expiry without a renewal decision,

13
00:00:49.156 --> 00:00:51.000
and none without an expiry.
